PORTED SOURCE CODE
==================

manga-image-translator (GPL-3.0)
  https://github.com/zyddnys/manga-image-translator
  pipeline/detect.js, pipeline/ocr.js, pipeline/merge.js, pipeline/quad.js, pipeline/pyset.js and
  parts of pipeline/text.js and pipeline/analyze.js are JavaScript ports of its text detection
  post-processing, OCR step, text-line merging, Quadrilateral geometry and text filters.
  Modified in 2026 by elClie: rewritten in JavaScript for in-browser use with ONNX Runtime Web.

manga-ocr (Apache-2.0), Copyright Maciej Budyś
  https://github.com/kha-white/manga-ocr
  pipeline/mocr.js ports its text post-processing. Modified in 2026 by elClie: rewritten in
  JavaScript. Its beam-search decoding reproduces the generation settings of Hugging Face
  transformers (Apache-2.0).

jaconv (MIT), Copyright (c) 2014 Yukino Ikegami
  https://github.com/ikegami-yukino/jaconv
  pipeline/mocr.js reimplements its half-width to full-width conversion (h2z).

py3langid (BSD-3-Clause), Copyright (c) 2021 Adrien Barbaresi; original code Copyright (c) 2011
Marco Lui
  https://github.com/adbar/py3langid
  pipeline/text.js reimplements its language identifier.

Emscripten (MIT)
  https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten
  tools/build_ext.mjs contains replacements for embind invoker functions adapted from
  Emscripten-generated code, so the vendored WebAssembly glue runs under the extension's CSP.


MODELS (release asset models.zip, not stored in this repository)
=================================================================

det16.onnx, det16.bin: text detector (DBNet) from manga-image-translator, GPL-3.0.
  Converted to ONNX by elClie.

PP-OCRv6_small_rec_top1.onnx, ppocrv6_dict.txt: text-line recognizer from PaddleOCR, Apache-2.0,
  Copyright PaddlePaddle Authors. https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
  Modified by elClie: the output head returns the per-step top-1 index and score.

mocr_encoder_fp16.onnx, mocr_decoder_fp16.onnx, mocr_vocab.json: manga-ocr-base, Apache-2.0,
  Copyright Maciej Budyś. https://huggingface.co/kha-white/manga-ocr-base
  Converted to ONNX (FP16) by elClie.

langid.bin, langid.json: the py3langid language model, BSD-3-Clause (see above).
  Converted to a binary layout by elClie.

unicode_tables.json: character-class tables generated from Python's Unicode data and cp932 codec.

panels.onnx: manga panel and text detector by Leandro Narosky, AGPL-3.0.
  https://huggingface.co/leoxs22/manga-panel-detector-yolo26n
  Fine-tuned from Ultralytics YOLO26 (Copyright Ultralytics, AGPL-3.0). Converted to ONNX by
  elClie. Combining this AGPL-3.0 model with this GPL-3.0 program is permitted by section 13 of
  both licenses; the model itself remains under AGPL-3.0.

  This model was trained on the Manga109-s dataset:
    K. Aizawa, A. Fujimoto, A. Otsubo, T. Ogawa, Y. Matsui, K. Tsubota, H. Ikuta, "Building a
    Manga Dataset 'Manga109' with Annotations for Multimedia Applications", IEEE MultiMedia,
    27(2), pp. 8-18, 2020. doi:10.1109/mmul.2020.2987895
  No Manga109-s images or annotations are included in this repository or its releases.


